[strategy/guidance/application/localization/GUID-APP-I18N-001-locale-formatting-guidance.md#rule-4-portal-studio-product-packages-declare-typed-properties]

### Rule 4: Portal Studio Product Packages Declare Typed Properties

When a domain team authors a UI component for Portal Studio, all date, time, datetime, currency, and number properties must be typed in the interaction contract. Portal Studio uses these declarations to apply platform formatting before values reach the component.

```json
{
  "properties": [
    { "name": "serviceDate",    "type": "date",     "format": "short" },
    { "name": "authExpiry",     "type": "datetime", "format": "medium" },
    { "name": "claimAmount",    "type": "currency",  "currency": "USD" },
    { "name": "memberAge",      "type": "number" }
  ]
}
```

