[strategy/guidance/application/localization/GUID-APP-I18N-001-locale-formatting-guidance.md#the-locale-concern-interface]

### The `locale` Concern Interface

The `locale` concern in `mmes-common-core` exposes the following interface across all supported languages:

```typescript
// TypeScript interface
export interface LocaleFormatter {
  formatDate(value: Date | string, locale: string, style?: DateStyle): string;
  formatTime(value: Date | string, locale: string, style?: TimeStyle): string;
  formatDateTime(value: Date | string, locale: string, dateStyle?: DateStyle, timeStyle?: TimeStyle): string;
  formatCurrency(amount: number, locale: string, currencyCode: string): string;
  formatNumber(value: number, locale: string, options?: NumberFormatOptions): string;
  formatRelativeTime(value: number, unit: RelativeTimeUnit, locale: string): string;
}

type DateStyle = 'short' | 'medium' | 'long' | 'full';
type TimeStyle = 'short' | 'medium' | 'long' | 'full';
type RelativeTimeUnit = 'day' | 'week' | 'month' | 'year' | 'hour' | 'minute' | 'second';
```

