### Dependency Declaration

Applications and Product Packages that use locale formatting must declare the dependency:

**`studio-manifest.json` (Portal Studio Product Package):**
```json
{
  "platformDependencies": ["@mmes/core/locale"]
}
```

**`package.json` (TypeScript/Next.js application):**
```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@mmes/core": "^1.x.x"
  }
}
```

**`Cargo.toml` (Rust service — via `mmes-common-core`):**
```toml
[dependencies]
mmes-common-core = { version = "1.x", features = ["locale"] }
```

